# Trait defined in a separate module — the cross-module import shape that
# was the actual regression cell. Track G (2026-07-28): a same-file trait's
# `Box[Trait]` receiver types as `TraitObject(trait_did)` and falls through
# to the terminal `error_id` silently; a CROSS-MODULE trait types as
# `Generic(Box, [Import(trait_did)])` and hits the `base_name=Some("Box")`
# branch — which E1's wrapper-reject then wrongly triggered on. This
# fixture pins the cross-module shape.

trait Speaker:
    String greet(self)
    int rank(self)
